OL,3,AVictoria Beckham's company makes its
OL,4,Afirst profit after 18 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictoria Beckham's fashion and beauty
OL,7,Fbusiness has made an operating profit
OL,8,Ffor the first time since she founded it
OL,9,Fin 2008, the company has said.
OL,11,FVictoria Beckham Holdings Ltd, which is
OL,12,Fled by the former Spice Girl as
OL,13,Fcreative director, made an operating
OL,14,Fprofit of #7.3m in 2025, accounts show,
OL,15,Fafter years of losses.
OL,17,F"We have all worked hard for a long
OL,18,Ftime for this moment of profitability
OL,19,Fand growth," Lady Beckham told the
OL,20,FFinancial Times.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
